{"unit_id":"esch30636__dsh-computer-use#card-zh","repo":"esch30636/dsh-computer-use","commit":"5cb65bcf3ece1e0f41fec581103623bcad9f6791","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-computer-use 是面向 Windows 桌面应用的 DSH 插件，注册 computer_* 工具来发现窗口、查看截图和 UI Automation 控件，并执行鼠标键盘操作。它支持启动应用、单步操作和批量步骤，按需启动 PowerShell helper，并显示可按 ESC 停止的覆盖层。适合需要用 DSH 操作图形应用的用户；需要 Windows 交互式会话及 PowerShell 5.1，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-135","lib/tools.js:513-772","lib/helper-client.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"esch30636__dsh-computer-use#card-en","repo":"esch30636/dsh-computer-use","commit":"5cb65bcf3ece1e0f41fec581103623bcad9f6791","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-computer-use lets DSH operate Windows apps through computer_* tools. It lists windows, captures screenshots and accessibility controls, and performs mouse/keyboard actions or batches. It can launch apps by name or path. It requires interactive Windows and PowerShell 5.1; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-135","lib/tools.js:513-772","lib/helper-client.js:1-20"]}
